      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For the camera I only double click the camera icon on the hand menu. Any time I open it from that tools radial, is an accident.\n\nPersonally I use both hands for the radials, the left hand for expressions most of the time, and then on the right hand I use that if I need to toggle personal mirror.\n\nOr if I'm being silly I'll have avatar scale on one hand, and gogo loco floating on the other",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-12-05T13:47:40.781Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm just really tired of having to hit back 5 times and forward 3 times just to get out of my Expressions tab and into my Emoji's tab... and then back 4 more times to get to Tools and pull out my Camera or Mirror....\n\nWould be nice if there were tabs on either side of the radial to quickly swap between persistent Tools/Emojis/Expressions/Options tabs to navigate menus quicker. \n\nCould be something like small floating wing/shoulder buttons on either side of the main radial - triggered by long holding the thumbstick in the button's direction, or maybe as thin buttons on either side of the Back button. Please consider something like this ; ;",
